OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal over body found
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body has been found following a fire
OL,7,Fat a property in Batley last weekend,
OL,8,Fpolice said.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said the body,
OL,11,Fwhich has not been formally identified,
OL,12,Fwas discovered following a large blaze
OL,13,Fat a building on the corner of Warwick
OL,14,FRoad and Mount Street, which was
OL,15,Freported at about 03:00 BST on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FThe cause of the fire has not yet been
OL,19,Festablished.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
